:: Deadwood Reblooms Property Facilities Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-home-reception-room'>>
  <<set _reception_property to maplebirch.get('Finance').realEstate.current>>
  <<if !_reception_property>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _reception_property.id is 'danube'>>Tall windows face the garden, with enough space between the table and the wall for someone to pass behind a seated guest. A sideboard holds spare glasses and folded linen. When you leave the doors open, you can hear the wind moving through the branches.
      <<else>>The long table stands a little way back from the windows. From the head of it, the town lies beneath you. The kitchen door opens beside the sideboard, leaving the window seats clear for guests.<</if>>
      You can set fewer places for a quiet meal, or open the room for visitors.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _reception_property.id is 'danube'>>高窗朝着庭院，桌子和墙壁之间留着空隙，能从坐着的客人身后走过。餐具柜里收着备用杯子和叠好的桌布。打开门，风吹动枝叶的声音便能传进来。
      <<else>>长桌离窗户稍远。坐在主位上，小镇就在你的脚下。厨房门开在餐具柜旁，窗边的位置都能留给客人。<</if>>
      你可以少摆些餐具，安静吃一顿饭，也可以开门迎客。
  <</language>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-home-staff-room'>>
  <<set _staff_property to maplebirch.get('Finance').realEstate.current>>
  <<if !_staff_property>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _staff_property.id is 'cliff'>>A narrow window looks towards the drive. Salt has marked the outside sill. Work coats hang beside the door, and a kettle stands on a little table away from the cleaning supplies.
      <<elseif _staff_property.id is 'danube'>>The service corridor leads here from the kitchen. There are lockers for personal belongings, a table for breaks and a noticeboard with space for the week's duties.
      <<else>>The room is tucked behind the service entrance, away from the guest lift. The building's ventilation hums above the lockers. A small table leaves enough space to eat without balancing a plate on someone's knees.<</if>>
      Staff can change here and leave their things out of the guests' way.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _staff_property.id is 'cliff'>>窄窗朝着车道，窗台外侧结着一层盐迹。工作外套挂在门旁，水壶放在一张小桌上，离清洁用品远些。
      <<elseif _staff_property.id is 'danube'>>从厨房出来，沿服务走廊就能到这里。个人物品柜摆在墙边，桌子留给休息的人，公告板上可以排下一周的工作。
      <<else>>房间藏在服务入口后面，离迎宾电梯远些。柜子上方传来通风设备的低鸣。小桌旁能坐下吃东西，不用把盘子架在膝盖上。<</if>>
      雇员可以在这里换衣服，收好随身物品，不必将它们放在客人走动的地方。
  <</language>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Property Wine Cellar
<<set _estate to maplebirch.get('Finance').realEstate>>
<<set _facility to _estate.facilities.find(facility => facility.id === 'wine_cellar')>>
<<if !_estate.current or !_facility>>
  <<lanLink ['Return to the agency', '返回房产中介'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Office'>><</lanLink>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<run _estate.enter('wine_cellar')>><<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The steps take you into a cooler room beneath the house. A low lamp catches the bottle labels without warming the racks. Beyond the shelves, two chairs stand at a small table. The noises upstairs reach you as a faint rumble.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    沿台阶下去，屋子底下比楼上凉些。低灯照着瓶身标签，不会让酒架发热。架子后面摆着一张小桌和两把椅子，楼上的声响传到这里，只剩隐约的低鸣。
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-home-company>>
<<deadwood-home-wine-menu>>
<br><<deadwood-home-exit 'wine_cellar'>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Property Screening Room
<<set _estate to maplebirch.get('Finance').realEstate>>
<<set _facility to _estate.facilities.find(facility => facility.id === 'cinema')>>
<<if !_estate.current or !_facility>>
  <<lanLink ['Return to the agency', '返回房产中介'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Office'>><</lanLink>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<run _estate.enter('cinema')>><<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if _estate.current.id is 'cliff'>>Heavy curtains keep the sea glare off the screen. A low shelf beneath it holds the films and controls. You can hear the surf when the sound is off.
    <<else>>Dark panels soften the room's echoes. The town remains visible through a narrow strip of glass until you close the blinds. A small lamp beside the seats lets you find your way without lighting the screen.<</if>>
    The seats are close enough to talk without raising your voice.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if _estate.current.id is 'cliff'>>厚窗帘挡住海面的反光。屏幕下方的矮柜收着影片和遥控器。关掉声音，就能听见海浪。
    <<else>>深色墙板吸去了房里的回声。放下遮光帘之前，仍能从一条窄窗望见小镇。座椅旁的小灯照着脚下，不会照亮屏幕。<</if>>
    座位靠得近，说话不用提高声音。
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-home-company>>
<<if _estate.life.ready('film')>>
  <<icon 'tv.gif'>><<lanLink ['Watch a comedy short (0:45)', '看一部喜剧短片 (0:45)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Life Finish'>>
    <<deadwood-home-life-act 'film' 'comedy'>>
  <</lanLink>><<lstress>><br>
  <<icon 'tv.gif'>><<lanLink ['Watch a mystery short (0:45)', '看一部悬疑短片 (0:45)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Life Finish'>>
    <<deadwood-home-life-act 'film' 'mystery'>>
  <</lanLink>><<lstress>><br>
<</if>>
<br><<deadwood-home-exit 'cinema'>>
